# E10 Iterated Prisoner Dilemma with the second prisoner of the variant commented in its Program.cs: tit for tat against a random prisoner (draws from the seed of the oracle): a variant of the oracles, the original sources but its line (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/PrisonerDilemmaRandom/).
# Sequential, so the C# fixes every line: the whole trace in order, the senders of the messages included.
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trace ^(.+)$
same trace seq
